    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our official discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support us by Wishlisting the game:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832090/extras/c4780c718efaa856fe4a8bc6b57188fb.poster.avif?t=1743073891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832090/extras/c4780c718efaa856fe4a8bc6b57188fb.webm?t=1743073891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>-Winner of the GDC Best in Play-<br><br>Bonnie the Turtle has just hatched. She\u2019s adorable, shelled,  Aw jeez!<br><br>Help Bonnie evade a series of dangers along with other turtles to reach their mum in the sea! Dodge seagulls, crabs, and other beachy obstacles as you shuffle for life. Every turtle you collect will also be under your control, so make sure to plan your movements wisely! <br> <br>Time is of the essence! Get those turts to safety!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support us by Wishlisting the game:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832090/extras/c4780c718efaa856fe4a8bc6b57188fb.poster.avif?t=1743073891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1832090/extras/c4780c718efaa856fe4a8bc6b57188fb.webm?t=1743073891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>-Winner of the GDC Best in Play-<br><br>Bonnie the Turtle has just hatched. She\u2019s adorable, shelled,  Aw jeez!<br><br>Help Bonnie evade a series of dangers along with other turtles to reach their mum in the sea! Dodge seagulls, crabs, and other beachy obstacles as you shuffle for life. Every turtle you collect will also be under your control, so make sure to plan your movements wisely! <br> <br>Time is of the essence! Get those turts to safety!",
